<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CSX raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSX raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said on Monday it had raised its rating for CSX Corp to outperform significantly from perform in line.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were up 3-1/4 at 49-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
